{"about_the_game":"Parasite Mutant is a sci-fi horror RPG set in the distant future. Psionic agent Nova was sent on a mission to an abandoned and secluded island city filled with horrifying creatures, not knowing that what happened on the island will completely change her fate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat System</h2>Parasite Mutant uses ATC (Active Time Chains) which combines the popular Active Time Battle system used in RPGs of the late-90s and a 3-segment chain system. Players will need to time their actions on each segments and decide whether they want to save their energy and do a chain release.[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the gauge fills up, players will need to dodge enemy attacks and launch their attack at the best possible time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that this little innovation of ours will bring an enjoyable and pleasant gameplay experience to our players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.poster.avif?t=1769091314\" width=468 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.webm?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/c2010be76d6f9e57ee131b115a173505.mp4?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art Style</h2>Parasite Mutant uses a semi-realistic anime art style and utilizes modern rendering techniques to give our players a HD visual experience. Additionally, we have introduced a retro filter and CRT filter to bring players back that late-90s to 2000s vibe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.poster.avif?t=1769091314\" width=468 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.webm?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/42a00eb8362c790ded1df66668f84d52.mp4?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.poster.avif?t=1769091314\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.webm?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/a00d13e321e849778430f5f61292bc77.mp4?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting</h2>Parasite Mutant is a survival horror game with a diverse array of horrifying mutants. In the game, players will solve various puzzles in search of answers and maybe uncover the horrifying secret of this universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.poster.avif?t=1769091314\" width=468 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.webm?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/0416734df6705a9085cee05c973abf61.mp4?t=1769091314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up System</h2>Parasite Mutant uses the classic equipment progression system. Players can attach various modules onto their equipment, or enhance their equipment using Plus Points that can be obtained through combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Game+</h2>Parasite Mutant has a New Game+ mode that allows players to inherit Plus Points from their previous playthrough. The New Game+ mode unlocks new locations where players have to continue to strengthen themselves and complete the final challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outfit System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/extras/94364a963bc1601e4a1c845f37541c67.avif?t=1769091314\" width=748 height=896 /></span><br>You will be able to change hairstyles, hair colors, outfits, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983000?t=1769091314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/70a876c1ab8c0d0d20af40041614c2be20a6adf5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769091314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/08057d72be62cc617b4657ebf1eadc17c5803f74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769091314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983000/08057d72be62cc617b4657ebf1eadc17c5803f74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769091314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4234670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Parasite Mutant is a sci-fi horror RPG set in the dis